{"sha": "7cf44d570816206d6b8fa0aa7ab8460db6ee69d216d7228beca1455286362a75", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "(1) 固定内点 $a$。由\\cref{lem:b2:realfun:slopes}，斜率", "$\\tau(h) = \\frac{f(a + h) - f(a)}{h}$ 是", "$h$ 的递增函数（两侧均成立，且 $\\tau(h_-) \\leq \\tau(h_+)$，其中 $h_- < 0 <", "h_+$）。因此 $\\tau$ 当 $h \\to 0^-$ 时有有限极限（递增，", "且以任一右斜率为上界） --- 此即 $f'_g(a)$ --- 并且当", "$h \\to 0^+$ 时极限为 $f'_d(a)$，且 $f'_g(a) \\leq f'_d(a)$。", "有限单侧导数蕴含 $a$ 处连续。关于单调性：", "对 $a < b$ 的内点，$f'_d(a) \\leq \\frac{f(b) - f(a)}{b -", "a} \\leq f'_g(b)$，同样由斜率不等式得出。", "", "(2) 当 $x > a$ 时：$\\frac{f(x) - f(a)}{x - a} \\geq f'_d(a) \\geq m$；", "当 $x < a$ 时：$\\frac{f(a) - f(x)}{a - x} \\leq f'_g(a) \\leq m$。二者", "整理后即得所需结论。", "", "(3) 对点数作归纳，完全仿照", "本科一年级分册中的做法（两点情形即为定义） --- 或一步完成：", "在 $a = \\sum\\lambda_i x_i$ 处应用 (2)，并将支撑线不等式", "在点 $x_i$ 处以权 $\\lambda_i$ 加权平均：$\\sum_i", "\\lambda_i f(x_i) \\geq f(a) + m\\sum_i\\lambda_i(x_i - a) = f(a)$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.2cm, height=5.4cm,", "    xmin=-2.4, xmax=2.5, ymin=-0.9, ymax=4.5,", "    xtick={-1.5, 0.5, 2}, ytick=\\empty]", "  \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=-2.1:2.15, samples=80]", "    {x^2};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=-1.5:2, samples=2]", "    {0.5*x + 3};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=-1.1:2.2, samples=2]", "    {x - 0.25};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omThm] at (axis cs:-1.05,3.15)", "    {弦};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omProp] at (axis cs:1.75,0.95)", "    {支撑线};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omDef] at (axis cs:-1.95,2.6) {$f$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 凸性一图尽览：在 $-1.5$ 与 $2$ 之间，", "函数 $f(x) = x^2$ 的图像位于其弦（定义）之下，", "并位于 $x = 0.5$ 处支撑线之上", "（见\\cref{thm:b2:realfun:convexreg}~(2)） --- 本章周末问题中的每一个不等式，", "都是对这两种位置关系的", "重新整理。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[端点处的不连续]", "在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上，函数 $f(0) = 1$，$f(x) = 0$（当 $x > 0$ 时）", "是凸函数，但在端点 $0$ 处不连续。结论（1）", "不可改进。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[角点与支撑线族]\\label{ex:b2:realfun:corner}", "对 $f(x) = \\abs x$，取 $a = 0$：单侧导数为", "$f'_g(0) = -1$ 与 $f'_d(0) = +1$，且", "由\\cref{thm:b2:realfun:convexreg}~(2)可知，", "\\emph{每一个}斜率 $m \\in \\intcc{-1}{1}$ 都给出一条支撑线：", "\\[", "\\abs x \\geq m\\,x \\qquad (x \\in \\R,\\ -1 \\leq m \\leq 1),", "\\]", "每个不等式恰在一条半直线上或在 $0$ 处取等号。凸函数", "在 $a$ 处可导，当且仅当支撑线族", "退化为单一直线（$f'_g(a) = f'_d(a)$）；角点处则", "有一区间的切线。此支撑线族正是凸优化中", "\\emph{次微分}的有限维雏形 ---", "而凸函数之所以如此稳健，正因为即使导数失效，", "支撑几何依然存在，这正是", "琴生证明所用的全部。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[幂平均不等式]\\label{ex:b2:realfun:powermeans}", "设 $0 < p < q$，$x_i$ 为正数，权 $\\lambda_i$", "之和为 $1$，对凸函数 $t \\mapsto t^{q/p}$", "在点 $x_i^p$ 处应用琴生不等式，得", "\\[", "\\Bigl(\\sum \\lambda_i x_i^{p}\\Bigr)^{1/p}", "\\leq \\Bigl(\\sum \\lambda_i x_i^{q}\\Bigr)^{1/q} :", "\\]", "幂平均随指数增大 --- 它包含 AM--QM 不等式，并且", "在极限 $p \\to 0$（见\\cref{exo:b2:realfun:6}）时，又得到", "AM--GM 不等式。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.6cm, height=5.6cm,", "    xmin=-8.5, xmax=8.5, ymin=0.5, ymax=4.5,", "    xtick={-4,-1,1,2,4}, ytick={1,2,4},", "    xlabel={$p$}, ylabel={$M_p$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=-8:-0.4, samples=90]", "    {((1/3)*(1^x + 2^x + 4^x))^(1/x)};", "  \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=0.4:8, samples=90]", "    {((1/3)*(1^x + 2^x + 4^x))^(1/x)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, dashed, domain=-8.5:8.5, samples=2] {4};", "  \\addplot[omThm, dashed, domain=-8.5:8.5, samples=2] {1};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omDef] at (axis cs:-5.4,1.55)", "    {$M_p(1,2,4)$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omThm] at (axis cs:-6.4,3.75)", "    {$\\max = 4$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omThm] at (axis cs:6.3,1.25)", "    {$\\min = 1$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omProp] at (axis cs:0.2,1.83) {$2$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 幂平均 $M_p$ 作用于取值 $1, 2, 4$（等权），", "作为指数 $p$ 的函数，单调递增：", "自 $\\min = 1$（$p \\to -\\infty$ 时）增至 $\\max = 4$（$p \\to", "+\\infty$ 时），依次经过调和平均（$p = -1$）、几何平均（", "$p = 0$ 处的缺口，取值 $2$）、算术平均（$p = 1$）与平方平均（$p", "= 2$）。整条经典均值不等式链", "即为一条单调上升的曲线 --- 在本章周末问题中", "第三部分予以证明。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}